window.products.push({"id":482023,"name":"Fypon PIL7X90 Pilaster, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r6VvAbyEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Pilasters are a type of door and window trim that are used to frame the vertical sides of doors and windows. Most often, they are used on front doors, but they are also used on garage doors and windows for texture and style. Originally created as a subtle alternative to columns, Pilasters share the same basic shape as columns, with a plinth block on top of the pilaster section, which can be Fluted, smooth, or PaneLED. The type of pilaster you choose should match your home exterior and personal style, and is sure to increase the value of your home and give it a distinctive look. Style and function any door or window trim adds style and function to your home. Door and window trim can be a tasteful accent for your home exterior and can also hide any flaws from the door or window installation. Pilasters are a distinctive type of trim that comes in a few Main varieties. The Fluted pilaster is meant to resemble the columns used in Greek and Roman architecture, which were usually Fluted. It is still considered the most elegant style for columns and Pilasters. New functions, new materials while the look of the Fluted pilaster is the same as the classical Fluted columns, the materials have changed. The original stone columns have often been replaced by wood columns in recent centuries because it is less expensive to work with and can be used widely on home exteriors. Until recent decades, most millwork was made with wood products. Today, Urethane materials have become a popular choice of material for millwork on home exteriors because they are less expensive than wood, and more resistant to cracking and rotting from sun and rain damage. Urethane materials are a favorite for home improvement projects due to their affordability and low maintenance. Offers Urethane Fluted Pilasters in a wide range of sizes to fit most doors and windows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r6VvAbyEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fypon","source_asin":"B004W5EY5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004W5EY5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004W5EY5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":482024,"name":"Fraser Hill Farm 58-in. Dancing Mrs. Claus with Hooded Cloak and Basket | Indoor Animated Holiday Home Decor | Motion-Activated Christmas Animatronic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":245.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JMm1z9CfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who's helping Santa and dancing along the way? Mrs. Claus, that's who! Our dancing Mrs. Claus from Fraser Hill Farm will dance right into your heart as she helps you greet your family, guests, or customers. Standing 58 inches tall and holding a basket filled with holiday greenery, she will be a delightful addition to your holiday decor in any home, office, or store. When motion is detected, she will move her arms and sway her body to the music. Dressed in an elegant hooded cloak trimmed with rich brocade and white fleece, her friendly face and warm smile will fill you and yours with holiday cheer! Pair her with our Dancing Santa in his matching suit for an extra special display (model # FASC058D-11RED sold separately).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JMm1z9CfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fraser Hill Farm","source_asin":"B0BGT9F5W2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGT9F5W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGT9F5W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
