window.products.push({"id":482145,"name":"Sanni Shoo Drip.it | Multifunctional Space Saving Stainless Steel Kitchen Sink Caddy | Bottle Holder | Compatible with Sodastream Bottles for Aqua Fiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWSP-gvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No more wet surfaces - Now bottles can drain over the sink: The stainless steel telescopic drainer mount allows drip.it to be placed over any sink. It is smoothly adjustable from 12.79 inches (32.5cm) to 22.24 inches (56.5 cm). No need for draining pads or trays, as the bottles drain directly into your kitchen sink. Fits almost all popular drinking bottles: The tray fits not only soda water bottles of the brands SodaStream or Aqua Fizz bottles. It is also perfectly suitable for a variety of baby bottles. There are four different openings: 2x 2.75 inches (7cm) 1x 1.69 (4.3cm), 1.25 inches (3.2cm). In its high-quality cardboard packaging also a beautiful and useful gift. Multifunctional organizer for your kitchen - This kitchen tool from the creator of drip.line (the dishcloth holder from Sanni Shoo) not only drains your drinking bottles hygienically: drip.it also works as a dishcloth holder, a neat storage for dishwashing utensils, a dryer for beeswax cloths and even as a coaster for hot things. Quality and high value materials: The tray is made of stainless steel with the highest precision. The soft ends are made of high quality and food safe silicone. Because of this, there are guaranteed no scratches on the sink or work surface. The telescopic rails and the removable plate are carefully made of brushed stainless steel. Swiss design and dishwasher safe: Our bottle drainer rack, bottle dryer and multifunctional kitchen helper is dishwasher safe. The silicone ends as well as the tray with the openings can be removed, which is also recommended when washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWSP-gvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanni Shoo","source_asin":"B0BDFKMJVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFKMJVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFKMJVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":482146,"name":"Tovolo Spatulart Ladybug & Leaves Spatula Long-Lasting Colorful, Summer Baking Tool, Dishwasher-Safe & BPA-Free Rubber, Non-Stick & Heat-Resistant Sil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XQNDwBzdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add some fun to your baking routine with Tovolo’s collection of vibrant printed, wood handled spatulas. The high-quality silicone head and fade-proof silicone ink makes this Spatulart Ladybug & Leaves Spatula a beautiful piece of art! The fun design is printed on both sides of the spatula with silicone ink, ensuring long-lasting kitchen artwork. Silicone is stain-resistant and fade-resistant, ensuring the spatula will look great for years to come. Whether you’re whipping up batter, scrambling eggs or icing baked goods, this kitchen utensil is as functional as it is charming. The flexible, curved edge scrapes bowls clean while the wooden rod in the center creates rigidity for thick batters and doughs. The soft-touch silicone will not scratch cast iron or nonstick pans. The ergonomic handle is designed to fit comfortably in hand as you mix, fold, scrape, spread, flip, and serve. The wood is tough, durable, and thick to tackle the toughest kitchen jobs. Removeable BPA-free silicone is scratch-resistant, stain-resistant, and food-safe for the best possible kitchen tool. To remove the head, simply pull. Wooden rod runs through the silicone head to keep it in place during use. The silicone head is BPA-free, dishwasher-safe, and food-safe for the best possible cooking experience. Wooden handle should be hand-washed. Silicone is heat resistant up to 600 degrees Fahrenheit. Made of wood and BPA-free silicone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XQNDwBzdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B07WN6ZV9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WN6ZV9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WN6ZV9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
