window.products.push({"id":482240,"name":"Sauder Cannery Bridge Credenza, for TVs up to 60\", Sindoori Mango","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":334.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ATuzgcXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your big TV deserves a stylish companion. Create a beautiful new look in any room of your home with this credenza from the Cannery Bridge® collection. This attractive TV stand accommodates up to a 60” TV, making it the perfect spot to gather around for binge-watching your favorite show, all-day movie marathons, or playing video games with your friends. Switch it up and use its spacious top surface as a place to display your favorite home décor items like an accent lamp, decorative plants, and your collection of knick-knacks. Its top surface also features a herringbone pattern for an extra touch of detail that is sure to stand out. It features two unique, easy gliding doors that slide side to side so you can display the best and hide the rest. It includes six adjustable shelves that you can move to different heights to create flexible storage options for items of all shapes and sizes. These shelves are ideal for holding your video and gaming components, storing stacks of movies and displaying additional decorations. The enclosed back panel includes cord access so you can keep all your wires neat and out of sight. Finished in Sindoori Mango®, this one-of-a-kind credenza is just what your home needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ATuzgcXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B0886X74HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0886X74HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0886X74HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":482241,"name":"WMF Damasteel 8-Inch Chef's Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BB1MDYCAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Damascene blades are synonymous with handcrafted weld art. The legendary Samurai swords have been esteemed for over 1000 years and conferred great respect on their owners. Damascene blades are still fascinating today because of the aesthetics and unusual razor sharpness. The traditional porcessing uses different kinds of steel, forged into hundreds of layers. Using new technologies, WMF has created this Damasteel Chef's knife with an 8 inch blade, with a blade steel that is unparalled in quality. Amazon.com Forged in the tradition of legendary samurai damascene swords, WMFs Damasteel knives have not only a unique aesthetic appearance but also a superior strength and sharpness that the manufacturer maintains is unsurpassed. Using the art of damascening, craftspeople forge the blades of several grades of steel in multiple layers to create a stronger bond, a sharper edge, and longer lasting sharpness of the blade. The mottled pattern on the blade of this 8-inch chefs knife resembles an animal print but is not just for show. The pattern is the result of a unique fusion process that further hardens the blade and allows it to be sharpened at a very acute angle. A high content of carbon is sprayed onto the steel blade at high pressure so the two elements cannot separate and then the blade is vacuum-fused and twofold isostatic pressed. The texture on the blade is caused by the alloys reacting to acids during this process. This 8-inch chefs knife is any kitchens most often used knife, tackling everything from mincing garlic to slicing leeks and carrots to dicing leftover roasted turkey meat--and the cost of this premium chefs knife is well worth it. A weighted bolster provides just the right amount of balance for comfortable and safe slicing. The full tang is encased in a beautiful brushed stainless-steel, hollow handle with a modern, squared-off shape. This high-quality knife is dishwasher-safe but WMF recommends hand washing it to protect the blade from damage. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BB1MDYCAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B0000U5GLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000U5GLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000U5GLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
