window.products.push({"id":482498,"name":"Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack, 2-Tier Adjustable Length(33.5-36.2in) Dish Rack Sink Shelf, Expandable Large Stainless Steel Dish Drainer for Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BSl+-xvOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍴[Space-saving & Mess-free Drainage]: This over the sink dish drying rack will save you space and simplify dishwashing. It maximizes the capacity of dishes while cutting down how much space it takes. Air-dry your dishes while keeping the kitchen organized. Over the sink shelf help drain and drip the water directly into the drain without messing the countertop. It'll bring you peace of mind– you don't want to overthink a task you do every day. 🍴[Adjustable Length]: Our over sink dish drying rack feature an adjustable frame(33.5\"- 36.2\") to fit any size sinks(single or double) and different kitchen layouts. The height frame will not affect the use of faucets. No matter whether your kitchen is spacious or tiny, having a quality sink drying rack can help organize your kitchen while providing a sanitary way to dry dishes. Air-drying dishes is not only more hygienic, but it’s also more convenient. 🍴[Durable & Stable]: These adjustable dish racks for kitchen counter is constructed from strong 304 stainless steel coated in black paint that protects against rust and scratches. The sturdy solid support can easily bear 110 pounds of weight. The legs feature a U-shape design to balance weight and stabilize the rack, which is bolstered by 4 anti-slip suction cups. So that you can use it safely and never worry about shaking or falling. 🍴[Free Combination]: The sink organizers include 8 S-shaped hanging hooks, a plate rack, a bowl rack, a cup-drying rack, a cutting board and lid rack, a knife holder, a utensil holder, a dish soap and sponge holder, and even a basket intended to hold fresh fruit or vegetable. The sink storage rack can accommodate up to 10 plates, 16 bowls, 8 glasses, and more. All accessories can be arranged according to your usage habits. 🍴[Easy Assembly and Cleaning]: The expandable frame requires simple assembly, all accessories just need a convenient snap-on structure for easy disassembly and cleaning. Attached installation manual is super easy to understand. So, it's time to switch to the multifunctional over sink dish drainer and enjoy a nice kitchen day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BSl+-xvOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"romision","source_asin":"B09B3THX3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3THX3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3THX3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
