window.products.push({"id":482544,"name":"2 Pieces Skeleton Hands Molds Halloween party for Sugarcraft, Cake Decoration, Handmade Ice Cream,Cupcake Topper, Chocolate, Pastry, Cookie Decor, Jew","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kjykgw1YL._AC_SL1146_.jpg","description":"Why do you need a silicone mold? This tool will help bring your crafting / cake decorating skills to a new level, enabling you to bring a professional quality to your work. Ideal for use with a wide range of edible and non edible materials, including sugarpaste, petal paste or marzipan. Make cake toppers, candy melts, candle decoration, paper clay crafting and more creative projects Silicone material is so versatile, the list for types of materials that can be used to create the moulds, is endless, such as Gum-paste, Jelly, Muffin, Fondant, Sugarpaste, Melted Chocolate, Wax, Ice, Soap, Epoxy Resin, and All types of Moulding Clays Material: Food-grade silicone Package Including: 2 x silicone mold Use and maintenance After each use, wash in the dishwasher or use hot water to clean.Make sure the silicone mold before each use and dry completely before storage. The silicon mold can be used only for the oven, oven and microwave oven, never can be used directly on the gas stove and induction cooker, or direct heating use. Do not use the knife or other sharp instruments on the silicone mold, not weight, pulling. The silicone mold dust absorption, easily.Long time need not when, put in the carton, placed in the shade. It is best to apply a little butter or oil before making. Note: Due to the display, camera, or other factors, there may be some chromatic aberration. Please refer to the physical product. Important Note: -This mold may be not as large as you imagine; Please pay attention to size info before you make payment. Because of the shooting light and display, please allow the color of the picture and the real object error - Before use: please clean and then disinfect in boiling water. - After use: Plea","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kjykgw1YL._AC_SL1146_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIALLAMS","source_asin":"B08KS2SJCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KS2SJCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KS2SJCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":482545,"name":"Mara Stoneware Farm Scene Barnyard Tractor 16oz Handcrafted Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91z8dqmyw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce, who painted many portraits of his lovely artist protégé. After studying art in London, she began working with high- temperature ceramics and created wonderfully unique glazes for her pieces. She then went on to study with the Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese, in Italy. Mara has had numerous expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico.Sadly, after a long illness, Mara passed away in November 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine works has continued. Mara’s husband, children and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara’s legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, has also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91z8dqmyw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mara Stoneware","source_asin":"B08JZDYJ8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JZDYJ8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JZDYJ8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
