window.products.push({"id":482549,"name":"TONZOM Canvas Wall Art Black and White Artwork Prints for Living Room Wall Art Picture Gift Home Decoration Canvas Print HD Printed Framed Ready to Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w-cMlS7SL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"🔘HIGH DEFINITION GICLEE PRINTING:This canvas prints wall art painting of modern style abstract woman design adopts the advanced GICLEE printing technology,which can ensure the high color resolution and long color durability of this canvas painting. Besides,the GICLEE printed canvas also wraps the frame edges to make it present a 3D effect. 🔘HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS:The quality and glossy polyester canvas is wrapped and stretched over a solid wood frame (rather than wooden MDF).And the environmental-friendly, odorless and formaldehyde-free ink is used for GICLEE printing, which makes sure this canvas painting is suitable for little kids or anyone with allergies. 🔘BRIGHTEN UP YOUR WALL:This delicate canvas prints wall art painting is of bright and vivid color which can keep unfading for more than 50 years. So it is absolutely an ideal wall decoration to living room, bedroom, kids room, children room, kitchen, dining room, study room, office, classroom, meeting room, guest room, cafe, coffee bar, restaurant,etc. 🔘PERFECT GIFT:Our canvas prints wall art paintings include numerous kinds of pattern in different styles and of different subjects to meet different people’s tastes, such as cute style for children,modern style for the young,antique style for the old,etc. So it is a great gift for kids, parents, relatives, friends, classmates, colleagues,etc. 🔘MORE HUMANIZED DESIGN:This canvas prints wall art painting is covered by a dust-resistant black light absorption cloth on the frame back,which not only makes it look more beautiful, but also protects the canvas painting better. Besides, a firm metal hanging hook is already mounted on the frame back, so it is convenient for you to hang it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w-cMlS7SL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TONZOM","source_asin":"B07CWLN61M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWLN61M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWLN61M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
