window.products.push({"id":482871,"name":"Lehman's Homemade Butter Making Set Butter Churn Crock Paddle Booklet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XNiXsQwxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Save $30 When You Buy in a Set! Fresh butter is easy to make when you have the right tools! We paired our best butter churn with some of our favorite butter helpers, so making farm-fresh butter is simple. Set includes:Lehman's Dazey Butter Churn. Curved butter paddle. Ancient-style butter crock. Making Cheese, Butter & Yogurt booklet. Note: These items come individually unwrapped and may ship separately. Lehman's Dazey Butter Churn Find Them Only at Lehman's! Long revered as the best butter churn design available, Lehman's has brought the Dazey churn back after a long hiatus. Glass Dazey butter churns are the original, since 1904. We now offer a smaller size with the same Dazey quality that you know. Of course, you can still find the large Dazey - perfect for big batches of butter! Original Dazey churns are available only from Lehman's. Turn cream to butter in 10-15 minutes. High quality stainless steel mechanism. When you need a lot of butter, choose the original large churn. Now improved so only easily cleaned glass and sanitary stainless steel touch your cream. Churns up to 2.5 qts of cream (80 ounces), twice as much as competing models. Improved paddle design shortens cream to butter cycle by 20%. Makes butter in as little as 15 minutes!. Wide 5\" opening makes butter removal faster and easier. Total capacity is 4 quarts. 16-1/4\"H, 6 lb. Assembled in USA (domestic and imported parts). Butter Crock Our ceramic butter crocks keep butter soft and fresh for up to 30 days. Simply pack the bowl with 1/2 cup of butter, fill the crock 1/4 full of cold water, and turn bowl upside down into water. Water forms tight seal to keep butter fresh. To serve, lift bowl out of crock and turn right side up again. Similar to centuries-old French butter storage system. 4\"H x 3-1/2\"OD. 1-1/2 lb. Curved Butter Paddle Specially curved and extra wide for easier handling (just like the traditional paddle)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XNiXsQwxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lehman's","source_asin":"B07NPHD2R5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NPHD2R5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NPHD2R5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
