window.products.push({"id":482925,"name":"Spy Gear Spy Metal Detector with detachable handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZZAYPK0QL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Discover the hidden evidence! On a spy mission, the clues aren't right in front of you - they're hidden. Use this real working metal detector to search for objects you might not see with the naked eye. You never know when you'll find just the thing to complete your mission! Amazon.com Search for hidden treasures in your back yard, at your neighborhood park, or on faraway beaches in exotic lands. This cool, lightweight metal detector features a 27-inch break-apart, detachable handle so you can hand hold the unit when you delve into the depths of the living-room sofa or attach the handle for treks through the wild unknown. This sleek, black-silver-and-blue unit has a duel warning system to alert you to the presence of metal: the LED lights up and the unit emits a high-pitched, steady beep. While unlikely to sense anything buried very deeply, this metal detector does a good job of finding coins or other metal objects at surface level. The metal detector operates on a 9-volt battery (not included), and rechargeable batteries are not recommended. This unit might just come in handy when you're searching for the wedding ring you lost in the flowerbeds! --Tami Horiuchi Review One 9-volt battery required One 9-volt battery required Sensing LED lights, sensitivity dial, detachable handle Sensing LED lights, sensitivity dial, detachable handle 1998 Dr. Toy 100 Best Children's Products 1998 Dr. Toy 100 Best Children's Products Supply is limited -- Supply is limited -- See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZZAYPK0QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spy Gear","source_asin":"B00000GC69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-482925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00000GC69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00000GC69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
